%% Journey to the West route map with full branching
%% English primary, Chinese auxiliary notes
flowchart TD
    A[Imperial Decree: Retrieve Sutras] --> B[Master Xuanzang departs Chang'an]
    B --> C[Five Elements Mountain: release Sun Wukong]
    C --> D[Team formation: Wukong + Bajie + Wujing]
    D --> E{Regional decision gate}

    E --> M1[Main Route: Mountain Trials]
    M1 --> M2[River and Marsh Crossings]
    M2 --> M3[Kingdom Diplomacy Arc]
    M3 --> M4[Fire Barrier Arc]
    M4 --> M5[Late Route Fortress Arc]
    M5 --> M6[Thunder Monastery Verification]
    M6 --> Z[Return East with True Sutras]

    %% Havoc in Heaven legacy branch
    E --> H0{Legacy turbulence from Havoc in Heaven?}
    H0 -->|Yes| H1[Residual celestial distrust appears]
    H1 --> H2[Title politics and identity traps]
    H2 --> H3{Escalation level}
    H3 -->|High| H4[Petition Guanyin mediation]
    H3 -->|Medium| H5[Evidence-first controlled engagement]
    H3 -->|Low| H6[Treaty settlement under witness]
    H4 --> M2
    H5 --> M2
    H6 --> M2
    H0 -->|No| M1

    %% Demon fortress branch
    M1 --> F0{Fortress domain encountered?}
    F0 -->|Yes| F1[Hostage verification and recon]
    F1 --> F2{Monk safety critical?}
    F2 -->|Yes| F3[Protective formation + tactical retreat]
    F2 -->|No| F4[Pincer strike and extraction]
    F3 --> F5[Regroup and reroute]
    F4 --> F5
    F5 --> M2
    F0 -->|No| M2

    %% River logistics branch
    M2 --> R0{Crossing blocked?}
    R0 -->|Storm| R1[Delay crossing, secure camp]
    R0 -->|Ambush| R2[Counter-ambush with rear guard]
    R0 -->|Passable| R3[Proceed with convoy]
    R1 --> R4[Recompute supplies and branch choice]
    R2 --> R4
    R3 --> M3
    R4 --> M3

    %% Diplomacy branch
    M3 --> D0{Court-level conflict?}
    D0 -->|Marriage or title trap| D1[Protocol negotiation path]
    D0 -->|Military pressure| D2[Civilian-safe extraction]
    D0 -->|None| D3[Resupply and blessing]
    D1 --> D4{Resolution}
    D2 --> D4
    D4 -->|Resolved| M4
    D4 -->|Unresolved| D5[Loop with stronger evidence]
    D5 --> M3
    D3 --> M4

    %% Fire barrier branch
    M4 --> FB0[Flaming Mountain blockade]
    FB0 --> FB1{Fan acquisition route}
    FB1 -->|Negotiation success| FB2[Open wind corridor]
    FB1 -->|Negotiation fails| FB3[Alliance + recovery operation]
    FB2 --> M5
    FB3 --> M5

    %% Final verification
    M6 --> V0{Canonical authenticity check}
    V0 -->|Mismatch| V1[Correction loop at monastery]
    V0 -->|Validated| V2[Archive and translation protocol]
    V1 --> V2
    V2 --> Z

    Z --> Z1[Mission closure and recognition]
    Z1 --> Z2[Aux CN note: 历劫归真, 功德圆满]
